      "MP-411. TrainingNextStep renders the prelicensing ladder from applications.license_progress, a twelve-value enum, against a six-rung STAGE_LADDER, and resolved the rung with Math.max(0, findIndex(...)). findIndex returns -1 for the six values not on the ladder — fingerprints_done, waiting_fingerprints, failed_test, exam_passed, in_field_training, licensed — and max() turned that -1 into 0, so the panel highlighted \"Enrolled\" as the agent's current stage while the label beside it had already degraded honestly to \"Continue your licensing\" via the function's own else-branch. An unknown position rendered as a confident wrong one, on the surface whose only job is telling a mid-licensing agent where they stand. MEASURED and reported as LATENT rather than as a leak: 0 live agents sit on an uncovered stage today (135 applications carry license_progress='licensed', but their agents row is licensed too, so they never reach this branch). It fires the first time the pipeline writes fingerprints_done or failed_test, or the first time the known license_status/license_progress divergence recurs. -1 is now the answer and the renderer was already built for it (every rung tests i <= stageIdx, so -1 highlights none). Seven tests grade the ladder against the repo's enum snapshot — which apex-doctor Check #29 already watches for prod drift — and require every rung to be a real enum member, every enum value to be either a rung or a NAMED exclusion, and every off-ladder value to resolve to -1. Three mutations proven red with each mutation asserted landed first, including restoring the original Math.max. The wave also attempted the obvious widening of the RPC status-literal guard to the 69 jsonb-returning functions it cannot reach, built it, ran it against live prod, and REFUSED it: it produced nine violations and all nine were false, because a jsonb payload is cast through `as unknown as` at every call site, which erases provenance and leaves file-level co-occurrence as the only key — the proxy-at-the-wrong-grain MP-410 already refused. That refutation is recorded in the guard's header so the next wave does not rebuild the trap.",
