      "The new-hire launch board could show you the process but never move anybody through it — and it was hiding most of the people. It showed 19 hires; there are 34. The 15 it dropped were everyone hired before the 1st of the month, 14 of whom are still mid-process: Isaiah Caldwell licensed and parked at onboarding for 133 days, Isaac Foster unlicensed at onboarding for 91, Jerald Winborne pre-licensed for 45. Every step on every card is now a control that writes, and the board carries every active hire instead of emptying itself on the 1st.",
